---
description: Keep hackathon planning, progress, branching, and attribution consistent
alwaysApply: true
---

- Follow the project working instructions in AGENTS.md.
- Read PROGRESS.md before work; after meaningful changes update PROGRESS.md and append to LOG.md.
- Use a separate branch for each new feature, normally `codex/<feature-name>`.
- Do not add AI authorship, co-author trailers, or AI signatures to Git commits. Verify the user's Git identity before committing.
- Planning does not authorize implementation; wait for the user to request the build.
